  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of the Land Administration Reform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A team from Michigan State University is conducting outreach and planning for a land tenure project in Lesotho. The program is funding evaluations of the Land Administration Reform Activity, which is set to deliver formally recognized titles to land assets of 55,000 urban households. The impact evaluation team is working to conduct outreach, develop impact evaluation design, develop and work plan and prepare for implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
